Cell id="f2-v79" value='&lt;span style="color:#6b675d;"&gt;h(t) = 1200 − 0,1875·t²   retropropulsores a partir de t = 59 s (h ≈ 547 m)&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6b675d;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="914.4" width="610.5" height="18.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2-v80" value='&lt;span style="color:#1d1d1b;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;executarDemoCompleta()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1d1d1b;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="945.2" width="224.2" height="22.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2-v81" value='&lt;span style="color:#6b675d;"&gt;roda tudo em sequência: cenário, regras, buscas, fila, resultado e descida&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6b675d;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="968.4" width="602.4" height="18.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2-v82" value='&lt;span style="color:#1d1d1b;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;sair&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DJetBrains%2BMono;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1d1d1b;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="999.2" width="45.7" height="22.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id=